"|vec_bool_type| **isinf**\\ (\\ |vec_type| x) :ref:`🔗<shader_func_isinf>`"
msgstr ""
"|vec_bool_type| **isinf**\\ (\\ |vec_type| x) :ref:`🔗<shader_func_isinf>`"

