"|gvec4_type| **textureProjGrad**\\ (\\ |gsampler2D| s, vec3 p, vec2 dPdx, "
"vec2 dPdy) :ref:`🔗<shader_func_textureProjGrad>`"
msgstr ""
"|gvec4_type| **textureProjGrad**\\ (\\ |gsampler2D| s, vec3 p, vec2 dPdx, "
"vec2 dPdy) :ref:`🔗<shader_func_textureProjGrad>`"

